 belles paroles. Et pourtant… Par amour pour elle, Samy quitte sa cité HLM et part gravir les mythiques 8848 mètres qui font de l’Everest le Toit du monde. Un départ qui fait vibrer ses copains, puis tout le 9-3 et c’est bientôt la France entière qui suit avec émotion les exploits de ce jeune mec ordinaire mais amoureux. A la clé, un message d’espoir : à chacun d’inventer son avenir, puisque tout est possible.","tagline":"Pour toi, je pourrais gravir l'Everest !"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/591isPg61zd1INkF0cJr5bIhYMB.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/591isPg61zd1INkF0cJr5bIhYMB.png","language":"it","width":1134,"height":209},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/byiBKVQ0BkhIei8KIX1bJfzcWAK.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/byiBKVQ0BkhIei8KIX1bJfzcWAK.png","language":"en","width":1268,"height":406},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jTxPpsd2NmjcMrI528RKyOfPc85.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jTxPpsd2NmjcMrI528RKyOfPc85.png","language":"en","width":651,"height":209},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/67PsZGVDnjWQJ6WhkkYGA4BxEsn.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/67PsZGVDnjWQJ6WhkkYGA4BxEsn.png","language":"fr","width":1267,"height":229},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jL7E5xgI1tSirfbIDr7T3Tk2k84.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jL7E5xgI1tSirfbIDr7T3Tk2k84.png","language":"fr","width":2763,"height":626}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tlNg2wOSuZOjgrbcLtbetOppUM5.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tlNg2wOSuZOjgrbcLtbetOppUM5.jpg","language":"en","width":720,"height":1080},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2qHNSZCmqQoCa2jGjr0lOtIV2rl.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/2qHNSZCmqQoCa2jGjr0lOtIV2rl.jpg","language":"en","width":600,"height":841},{"type